1
00:00:05,349 --> 00:00:07,059
(Bernadette:)Are you sure you guys don't
want to come with us to Napa?

2
00:00:07,218 --> 00:00:08,458
(Bernadette:)You could probably still get a room.

3
00:00:08,619 --> 00:00:11,029
(Penny:)No, I think we're just gonna
have a quiet weekend at home.

4
00:00:11,188 --> 00:00:12,568
(Leonard:)Plus, I'm not sure it's a great idea

5
00:00:12,723 --> 00:00:15,033
(Leonard:)to take Penny
to where wine comes from.

6
00:00:17,995 --> 00:00:19,165
(Leonard:)What? It's a joke.

7
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,570
(Leonard:)Oh, come on.
We bust on each other.

8
00:00:21,732 --> 00:00:23,872
(Leonard:)I wear dorky glasses,
you might have a problem.

9
00:00:24,035 --> 00:00:25,745
(Leonard:)It's all for laughs.

10
00:00:27,071 --> 00:00:30,021
(Penny:)That would really piss me off if
I didn't have a buzz going on.

11
00:00:33,844 --> 00:00:38,194
(Sheldon:)Howard, which pocket watch will you
be wearing for dinner on the train?

12
00:00:44,021 --> 00:00:45,261
(Howard:)I'm sorry, what?

13
00:00:46,190 --> 00:00:48,430
(Sheldon:)I'm afraid if we wear
the same pocket watch,

14
00:00:48,592 --> 00:00:50,192
(Sheldon:)it will be embarrassing.

15
00:00:51,862 --> 00:00:54,172
(Howard:)I don't own a pocket watch.

16
00:00:54,999 --> 00:00:56,669
(Sheldon:)Oh, my.

17
00:00:56,834 --> 00:01:04,024
(Sheldon:)Well, then my apologies
for bringing up this sore spot.

